1
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:36,330
Li'er,

2
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:37,500
look.

3
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,900
The path we didn't finish 300 years ago,

4
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,630
we can finally finish it today.

5
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:42,860
You must be joking, Your Majesty.

6
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,000
The path is still long.

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,800
We might not be able to finish it.

8
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:47,600
We've come this far,

9
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:49,100
and you're still being stubborn.

10
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,230
After the ceremony,

11
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,060
we will rule the Six Realms together.

12
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:52,960
As for the past,

13
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,730
I can let it go.

14
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:56,560
The auspicious time is almost here.

15
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,360
The shadow guards should make their move.

16
00:00:58,360 --> 00:00:59,890
The auspicious time is set.

17
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:01,760
The auspicious time is approaching.

18
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:03,330
The Three Realms celebrate together.

19
00:01:03,330 --> 00:01:05,530
The imperial wedding ceremony begins.

20
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,760
The auspicious time has arrived.

21
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:14,260
Do it.

22
00:01:27,330 --> 00:01:27,789
My wife,

23
00:01:28,830 --> 00:01:31,060
you look so beautiful in this wedding dress today.

24
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:32,530
If I had known you'd dress like this,

25
00:01:32,530 --> 00:01:35,130
it would have been worth staying in the heavenly prison for a few more days.

26
00:01:35,130 --> 00:01:35,590
Shut up.

27
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,490
Let's get out of here first.

28
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:47,860
Bai Li, Bai Li.

29
00:01:48,330 --> 00:01:50,300
Did you really think I was unprepared?

30
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:51,759
With just this little trick,

31
00:01:51,759 --> 00:01:53,660
you dare to run wild in my hall?

32
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,430
Protect the Lord!

33
00:02:09,830 --> 00:02:10,490
It's a trap.

34
00:02:11,430 --> 00:02:11,860
Go.

35
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:19,760
Did you think your diversion tactic could fool me?

36
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:21,060
Those few guards at the heavenly prison

37
00:02:21,060 --> 00:02:22,730
were intentionally shown to you.

38
00:02:22,730 --> 00:02:25,000
I just wanted to make you think there was an opportunity,

39
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,660
so that all of you would walk right into the trap.

40
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:28,820
You knew all along.

41
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:31,500
From the day you stood alone at the South Heaven Gate,

42
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:33,030
I knew you were up to no good.

43
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:34,160
Bai Li,

44
00:02:34,829 --> 00:02:36,160
you're still so stupid.

45
00:02:36,460 --> 00:02:38,600
You always think you've calculated everything perfectly,

46
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,430
but your mind,

47
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:41,520
I figured it out 300 years ago.

48
00:02:42,829 --> 00:02:44,090
Since I can't have you,

49
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,620
I'll just have to destroy you.

50
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:05,230
This broken hairpin again.

51
00:03:05,730 --> 00:03:07,790
Cang Yuan relies on this piece of junk

52
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:09,460
to wrap you around his finger.

53
00:03:19,460 --> 00:03:20,329
Don't touch it.

54
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:11,990
This was left to me by my mother.

55
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,100
I give it to you today.

56
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:13,530
Li'er,

57
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,500
when I ascend to the throne,

58
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:17,060
you will be the Heavenly Empress.

59
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:19,120
I will protect you for all lifetimes.

60
00:04:33,130 --> 00:04:37,230
Maybe I shouldn't have met you 300 years ago.

61
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:52,100
The ground is cold.

62
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:52,560
My wife,

63
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:53,300
get up.

64
00:05:08,330 --> 00:05:08,930
Cang Yuan,

65
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,290
are you okay?

66
00:05:14,630 --> 00:05:15,630
I'm fine.

67
00:05:17,030 --> 00:05:18,030
Raise your hands.

68
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,400
These are known as the supreme treasure of the Heaven Realm,

69
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:29,230
the immortal iron chains that even the old Demon Lord in his prime couldn't break,

70
00:05:29,230 --> 00:05:31,160
and they just shattered like this.

71
00:05:33,300 --> 00:05:33,730
You

72
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:34,659
remembered

73
00:05:34,659 --> 00:05:35,300
everything,

74
00:05:35,300 --> 00:05:35,960
didn't you?

75
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,159
You remembered everything.

76
00:05:39,159 --> 00:05:39,490
Then,

77
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:42,630
do you still acknowledge me as your husband?

78
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:44,560
I acknowledged you a long time ago.

79
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:47,290
Then when we get out,

80
00:05:47,330 --> 00:05:48,700
we'll make up for the wedding ceremony.

81
00:05:48,700 --> 00:05:49,159
Shut up.

82
00:05:49,430 --> 00:05:50,490
Get some good rest.

83
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,220
As for them,

84
00:05:51,430 --> 00:05:52,360
leave them to me.

85
00:05:54,159 --> 00:05:54,690
I knew it.

86
00:05:55,500 --> 00:05:56,700
My wife is the best.

87
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,490
Take Cangyuan away.

88
00:06:04,660 --> 00:06:05,900
He is severely injured now

89
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:07,200
and must be treated as soon as possible.

90
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:07,400
Yes.
